; The expression-grade coverage instrumenter. Exposed as
; ppx_windtrap's instrumentation backend (the (instrumentation.backend)
; stanza on the ppx_windtrap library names this rewriter); usable
; directly with (preprocess (pps ppx_windtrap.coverage)) too, which the
; semantics tests rely on. ppx_runtime_libraries makes every
; instrumented library link the windtrap.coverage runtime the generated
; code calls - and nothing else: instrumented user code must never pull
; the windtrap core into its closure.

(library
 (name windtrap_coverage_ppx)
 (public_name ppx_windtrap.coverage)
 (kind ppx_rewriter)
 (libraries ppxlib)
 (ppx_runtime_libraries windtrap.coverage)
 (preprocess
  (pps ppxlib.metaquot)))
